as well. And that’s why we wanted to create a&nbsp;
platform that would allow retail investors to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:48.680
adapt to the changing investing landscape with&nbsp;
the help of bonds. With our platform, Silo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

