yields of 4-7% all with the safety of $500,000 in&nbsp;
SIPC insurance and $2.5 million in FDIC insurance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:07.440
This is precisely what all of the big tech&nbsp;
